    imageBrief: 'Warm finely detailed watercolor/gouache and colored pencil, tactile paper, golden autumn stone village square. Neri matches L264, brown ragged hooded cloak and honey satchel; Isona matches L268, short wavy black hair, mustard vest and indigo tunic. Bruna, adult seller with short dark curls, light blouse and green-blue shawl, sits on a plain stool at the shaded end of wooden ribbon counter under a tree. She holds one woven ribbon bow; a working basket stands beside her. Neri and Isona stand looking at her. Ribbon trays visible on counter, broad passage unobstructed in front. No modern props or readable text.',
